			description: [
				"the &6HV macerator&r unlocks the 2nd and 3rd output slots on ore processing. before this, almost every byproduct was silently discarded. after this, effective ore yield doubles or triples."
				""
				"retrofit your existing washer and centrifuge lines. prioritize ores with valuable 2nd and 3rd outputs: iron, copper, gold."
