			description: [
				"&abauxite and ilmenite&r on the moon both yield &arutile dust&r. rutile -> HV chemical reactor -> TiCl4 -> EBF with magnesium -> titanium ingot."
				""
				"MgCl2 byproduct electrolyzes back into mg and Cl2, which loop cleanly back in. net input is just rutile. run bauxite through the full ore chain for best yield."
