			description: [
				"desh takes five steps: three HV chemical reactors (crushed ore -> sulfate slurry -> desh carbonyl -> condensed carbonyl), then the EBF at 2700K, then the &5vacuum freezer&r."
				""
				"byproducts from step 3 include manganese, cobalt, and nickel. CO recycles back into step 2. &adesh ingot&r -> wiremill -> desh wire, which replaces electrum wire in the micro processor computer recipe."
			]
